  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">6. The support is for UNAIDS to scale up technical support to country partners for Global Fund proposal development and effective grant implementation. In the MfFAs Strategy for Global Development Cooperation 2008 - 2010, Sida is instucted to support UNAIDS with 20 MSEK per year for technical support to country partners for Global Fund proposal development and implementation during 2008-2010.</narrative>
